msgstr "co %s s"

msgid "Choose camera"
msgstr "Wybierz kamerę"

msgid "Install python3-pillow to turn or mirror images:\nopkg install python3-pillow"
msgstr "Zainstaluj python3-pillow, aby obracać lub odbijać obrazy:\nopkg install python3-pillow"

